# Free Esports Tournament App — Setup Guide

## Step 1: Files rakho
- index.html (users ke liye)
- admin.html (aap aur dost ke liye)
- README.md

## Step 2: Test karo
Dono files ko Chrome mein khol lo. Data localStorage mein save hoga.

## Step 3: Free hosting (real users ke liye)
1. https://vercel.com pe free account banao
2. New Project → files upload karo
3. Live URL milega (jaise your-app.vercel.app)
4. admin.html ka URL sirf aap dono ke paas rakho

## Step 4: Google Sheets backend (real database)
Abhi data localStorage mein hai — user ke device pe.
Real app ke liye Google Apps Script use karo (next message mein code dunga).

